The story is set in the magical Academy called Saint-Eworth.

Familiars are unique to the summoner, they are summoned once, on the first day of the first year at Saint-Eworth, and then are forever bonded. If the summoner, or familiar, is killed, then both die. 

Familiars are used in classes, in duels between students, in tournaments, and in battles against the forces of darkness.

